        "body": "Bumps [pinia-plugin-persistedstate](https://github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate) from 3.2.3 to 4.2.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate/releases\">pinia-plugin-persistedstate's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v4.2.0</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate/compare/v4.1.3...v4.2.0\">compare changes</a></p>\n<h3>🚀 Enhancements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>nuxt:</strong> Infer global <code>cookieOptions</code> to specified <code>cookie</code> storage without options (<a href=\"https://github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate/commit/3c55848\">3c55848</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>nuxt:</strong> Explicit Nuxt plugin name (<code>pinia-plugin-persistedstate</code>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate/commit/a0a4c51\">a0a4c51</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🩹 Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>nuxt:</strong> Check <code>@pinia/nuxt</code> module installation by <code>pinia</code> key (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate/pull/359\">#359</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🏡 Chore</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump dependencies (incl. pinia^2.3.0 &amp; <code>@​pinia/nuxt</code>^0.9.0) (<a href=\"https://github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate/commit/c71d618\">c71d618</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>❤️ Contributors</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Prazdevs (<a href=\"http://github.com/prazdevs\"><code>@​prazdevs</code></a>)</li>\n<li>Donald Shtjefni (<a href=\"http://github.com/dnldsht\"><code>@​dnldsht</code></a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>v4.1.3</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate/compare/v4.1.2...v4.1.3\">compare changes</a></p>\n<h3>📖 Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the afterHydrate describe (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plugin-persistedstate/pull/350\">#350</a>)</li>\n<li>Fix install script groups (<a href=\"https://github.com/prazdevs/pinia-plug