          "patch_url": "https://github.com/space-wizards/space-station-14/pull/34161.patch",
          "merged_at": null
        },
        "body": "## About the PR\r\nChanged some drink names to be more SS14 lore themed.\r\n\r\n## Why / Balance\r\nThere were a lot of differing views regarding a recent suggested change to a drink name in the game, which seemed in danger of descending into debates about real-world politics. I thought that one of the better suggestions to come out of this was to name some drinks with in-game themes. It was also suggested, that in future, it would make more sense to edit the localisation files rather than rename entity IDs, allowing for easier forking and less potential merge conflicts.\r\n\r\nThis a draft for now, as current changes will cause conflict with an approved PR, and I thought people would want to have some input and be able have their suggestions added to this before it is put up for review.\r\n\r\n## Technical details\r\nChanges the names and descriptions of drinks in the localisation .ftl file(s).\r\n\r\n## Media\r\n\r\n## Requirements\r\n- [ X] I have read and am following the [Pull Request and Changelog Guidelines](https://docs.spacestation14.com/en/general-development/codebase-info/pull-request-guidelines.html).\r\n- [ X] I have added media to this PR or it does not require an ingame showcase.\r\n\r\n## Breaking changes\r\n<!-- List any breaking changes, including namespaces, public class/method/field changes, prototype renames; and provide instructions for fixing them.\r\nThis will be posted in #codebase-changes. -->\r\n\r\n**Changelog**\r\nI assume, though cosmetic, these changes might be relevant enough for bartenders to be informed of?\r\n:cl:\r\n- tweak: Irish bool, irish car bomb, irish cream, irish coffee, renamed to: exploding syndicat, grenade penguin, gorlex cream, cybersun coffee. \r\n\r\n",
