        "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
        "body": "> I think \"Bloody Mary\" is fine, I mean, it's from an urban legend and I see those surviving to whatever year SS14 is set in... not to mention we do have some supernatural elements in the game.\r\n> \r\n> I like the \"Revolutionary\" for Cuba Libre, and maybe Black Tide and White Tide for Black Russian and White Russian respectively ? Or would that be too meta ?\r\n\r\nAgree with bloody mary. You'd think that references to black/white/grey tide might be too meta, but it is referenced already in posters, books, entity descriptions and even gost role rules I think, so I would have thought adding it to a drink name wouldn't be an issue necessarily. I like the concept you are going with here, certainly.",
