        "body": "_:hammer_and_wrench: Refactor suggestion_\n\n**Enhance input validation and error handling.**\n\nThe mutation should handle various error cases and include input validation:\n1. Consider adding size limits for the answers list\n2. Add error cases to handle:\n   - Invalid access level for user's role\n   - Duplicate collection names\n   - Invalid answer formats\n\n\nConsider adding a union type for error cases:\n\n```graphql\ntype CreateAnswerCollectionResult = AnswerCollection | ValidationError | DuplicateNameError | AccessLevelError\n\ntype ValidationError {\n  message: String!\n  field: String!\n}\n\ntype DuplicateNameError {\n  message: String!\n  existingCollectionId: Int!\n}\n\ntype AccessLevelError {\n  message: String!\n  requiredRole: String!\n}\n```\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment by CodeRabbit -->",
