          "message": "Add inference percentile details to driver perf (#3504)\n\nUse flag --r or --runtimes with perf to export times to JSON\r\n\r\nUpdated perf output:\r\n\r\nBatch size: 1\r\nRate: 898.852 inferences/sec\r\nTotal time: 1.11253ms (Min: 1.095ms, Max: 3.7384ms, Mean: 1.14045ms, Median: 1.11241ms)\r\nPercentiles (90%, 95%, 99%): (1.12391ms, 1.13541ms, 1.22018ms)\r\nTotal instructions time: 2.40689ms\r\nOverhead time: 0.0542455ms, -1.29436ms\r\nOverhead: 5%, -116%",
