            "email": "Ilija.Kalinic@amd.com",
            "name": "Ilija Kalinić"
          },
          "message": "Fix sd3-lite clip-l model swapped outputs (#3704)\n\nThe clip-l model from stable-diffusion-3-lite-onnx has swapped outputs, so this results in runtime error because of mismatched shapes. This fix proposes swapping the output tensors for the clip-l outputs if the shape doesn't match the required shape for one of the outputs, making stable-diffusion-3-lite-onnx run successfully.",
