        "closed_at": null,
        "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
        "active_lock_reason": null,
        "body": "'ultrasat.tools.getFOVcorners' return the coordinates of the corners for a given RA,Dec.\r\nIt is based on 'celestial.coo.center2corners'.\r\n\r\nHowever, in both cases the functions do not allow for rotation of the field (aka 'position angle' or 'roll').\r\nThis is essential to ULTRASAT...",
