        "updated_at": "2025-01-01T15:19:20Z",
        "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
        "body": "First wished to enhance **celestial.coo.center2corners**, but finally found it easier to make a new function, which is currently internal to **ultrasat.tools.getFOVcorners**, where the new functionality is added: try, e.g.\r\n```\r\nC0   = ultrasat.tools.getFOVcorners(215., 60., 'Roll',0);\r\nC30 = ultrasat.tools.getFOVcorners(215., 60., 'Roll',30);\r\nC90 = ultrasat.tools.getFOVcorners(215., 60., 'Roll',90);\r\nfigure; \r\nplot(C0(:,1),C0(:,2),'*'); hold on\r\nplot(C30(:,1),C30(:,2),'*');\r\nplot(C90(:,1),C90(:,2),'*');\r\n```\r\nand alike. ",
